cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FMR IMA Layer-1 planner — literature-anchored exploratory surrogate"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it and the Galili RSOS 2022 source data."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "FMR IMA Layer-1 planner contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Coucou2016/fmr-ima-layer1-planner"
url: "https://github.com/Coucou2016/fmr-ima-layer1-planner"
abstract: >
  Transparent Layer-1 Python surrogate for exploratory screening of indirect
  mitral annuloplasty (IMA-CS / IMA-AP) strategies under stated geometric and
  risk-screening assumptions. Phenomenological mechanics plus a
  literature-calibrated leakage proxy — not production FEA/FSI and not a
  clinical decision aid.
keywords:
  - functional mitral regurgitation
  - indirect mitral annuloplasty
  - surrogate model
  - exploratory screening
  - coronary sinus
license: MIT
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-14"
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Numerical biomechanics modelling of indirect mitral annuloplasty treatments for functional mitral regurgitation"
    authors:
      - family-names: Galili
        given-names: L.
    year: 2022
    doi: "10.1098/rsos.211464"
  - type: data
    title: "Data from: Numerical biomechanics modelling of indirect mitral annuloplasty treatments for functional mitral regurgitation"
    year: 2022
    doi: "10.5061/dryad.bzkh1899d"
